    "detailed_description": "Remission<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDue to a Radioactive accident at the Hospital, Cancer cells have mutated into human form<br />\r\nThe mayor has asked DR. Rose to stop them<br />\r\nIt is up to You to help her find the cure to save the city, and save us all<br />\r\nDive into a world of danger, strategy, and storytelling, where every choice matters<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFace off against unique enemy types, each with different stats<br />\r\nIntense combat with a diverse range of Weapon types<br />\r\nDynamic Spawning Enemy System<br />\r\nQuests<br />\r\nUse Chemo shots to regain health<br />\r\nVaulting Mechanics<br />\r\nMutant AI Behavior System<br />\r\n3rd Person Character<br />\r\nVarious in-game objects to find<br />\r\nA large immersive city environment for your adventures<br />\r\nHighly optimized<br />\r\nRealistic movement and combat actions<br />\r\nEngaging bonus system rewards performance with points, offering progression<br />\r\nEnemies bring diversity and challenge to every encounter<br />\r\nNavigate with a comprehensive HUD that provides crucial information at a glance<br />\r\nMonitor health, Armor, stamina, and flashlight usage, ensuring you're always prepared for the challenges ahead<br />\r\nSave/Load the game seamlessly for a continuous adventure<br />\r\nTweak with various Video, Audio, and Graphics options to achieve your desired settings<br />\r\nManage your items seamlessly with an intuitive inventory system<br />\r\nMusic and SFX",
